OL,3,CCrews tackling large fire with plumes
OL,4,Cof smoke seen for miles
OL,6,FA large fire has broken out in the
OL,7,FTitchfield area of Hampshire.
OL,9,FLarge plumes of smoke can be seen for
OL,10,Fmiles around.
OL,12,FFire crews are at the scene where the
OL,13,Ffire is believed to have started in a
OL,14,Ffield in the Posbrook Lane area of the
OL,15,Fvillage.
OL,17,FAn eyewitness said they believe a
OL,18,Fcombine harvester caught fire and
OL,19,Fanother farm vehicle being used to tow
OL,20,Fit away, also caught alight.
